VMF solid resolution:
Use VMF deserialiser
Build a structure per-plane of dot products with normal vectors of other planes; elements close to zero help distinguish:

Cube/Cuboid: all but one (the parallel side) = zero | for all sides 
Right-angled triangular prism: Two non-zero for hypotenuse plane side; one for shadow sides (since they are a parallel pair), one for adjacent/opposite sides from the plane side

Many-face (>6):
Sphere: Apex point(s) is a plane point in >=6 faces [Check this before cylinder]
Cylinder: Has a lot of sides but cap sides are a parallel pair with all others perpendicular
